## Predictions (written before the run)
- the flag is the switch: agitated units close on the dwarves and combat reports involving citizens appear, where the control has none
- the flag needs a relation too: agitated units behave no differently; approach distance and citizen combat match the control
- the flag decays: the agitated count read at each sample sits below the wild land count, since the count is taken before that pass re-applies it

